{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB 娛樂訪談節目《一周星星》，今集特別加長至一小時，主持許文軒（Edmond）貼身直擊譚詠麟（校長）《譚詠麟與您「刻骨銘心」世界巡迴演唱會—終極篇》香港站備戰實況，更在完成十場演唱會後，與校長真情對話，以及大談鏡頭背後不為人知的傷痛與感動。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916076576215040103792.jpeg/VG6YDOpWj3by1aqpOfv250EwhZ7QdVv-8wQTQ_MEE0M\"/><p>「好似係告別又未必係告別。」校長一番話道盡對舞台的不捨。今次終極篇個唱由籌備到完成，校長心態與以往截然不同：「對自己嚟講應該唔會再做一啲大型嘅演出。」On Show 時的校長從容不迫，心情相當輕鬆，Edmond 在校長身上看見甚麼叫「舉重若輕」，校長親解箇中舞台哲學：「我所有嘢準備咗十成，但上到台所有嘢我唔會再理，之前做晒咁多嘢能夠變 200%出嚟當然係最好，若果只能夠交出七、八成我都由佢，隨緣。」談到校長金曲威力驚人，某一些歌一唱即會引起全場哄動，校長笑言經典金曲還有神奇功效：「我啲朋友話，突然間見有幾個人喺輪椅度彈起身，識行得返。」</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916155479461888165270.jpeg/U6Eeug1bT0TsgtIDM9JmvoPveCcN5y27YLoqhWC6KoU\"/><p>節目中，校長自爆有一幕表演令他勾起父母陪同開騷畫面：「爹哋媽咪係我最忠實嘅歌迷」、「好多片段我都記得」、「着衫嗰吓覺得屋企人仲望住」，在紅館演唱會尾場，校長向上天作飛吻，場面感人。校長更自揭在演唱會期間，身體曾出現問題，只好忍痛完成個唱。另外，不少 Fans 隔空現身向校長表白：「等緊大灣區開我哋會去聽」、「希望佢身體健康唱到 80 歲」、「最好一路開落去」，校長聞言相當感動。</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916310547337216265019.jpeg/7PLGULkRGXghjsIkGScgNSarumzOu_ckMy7VIzMu1SM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916308135481344731204.jpeg/V3Q5qOAkP7O7hOok8tBCCivl0f1HYxeYiec4TInnOEw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916305786540032791845.jpeg/s5RGmNtKdiTyPt4Ubj4TaKvNnYIb6L8NwKdztcCnc7U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916314297307136745236.jpeg/I76HUSF5WWf8Pi7vX4vJKRNUs_a17GHdOZBnDTmQZw0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916312195829760385614.jpeg/wE2_SHP9VtDv4dZKk71mmEQDjpZ_LYsgbEuPiGxLj4g\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916310119518208683451.jpeg/-fG-yIGgA2XFydwPCfAqMM0u-ZG_bqlDq6W_1Kulv9Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916307963514880617835.jpeg/EegiMMhRQfX-cJvGuwOPxEnq1Ea_4Ff4Mq6poDKuqaA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916305794928640235180.jpeg/qaPThSylAnEI_QZbqwg8cLEdcqFzU7gdtFdZKLRXWSg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916315308134400234670.jpeg/xiL2zWLDT5nF0ChLXr_iHBiAZHak8_ZuGE1lsRhNZbE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916312774643712390862.jpeg/6YQXN16TPbqt3x99ZHkR6cHeRbmG51PMYu78VmLu_FY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916310547337216023416.jpeg/7Wv4rY1oBfROcla0Jd0fgsU_a665vfvzDMyzLwzMsy8\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916308148064256418095.jpeg/Uzo0kCCDYjM8bvPZraLqVTiK5Zw7Erk1_lORrP5Tkaw\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916305916563456184905.jpeg/dxy6ez6CZtohfjy1HTdZTvtar_wOv9YivDr8MLw6_DA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916314892898304431879.jpeg/rTvbD9gP9WFDit7WbJjVsUByE3pjuD2FDY63QQ2Ot0E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916312678174720950871.jpeg/7w5CtKXDbOZaF4TDn22k7x8wj5B6hTIINhaACzYWgAs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916310551531520629537.jpeg/bsr19Qqxypb20gTyxDEJPlcxhTSkz6xY7Yt7CO2Lewg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916308043206656409381.jpeg/wQPxWmRPx3u_Pfkw2C5snaPKK4_tOdDRb3ihuG94obg\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261011/1185916305891397632302974.jpeg/JqXTKJKupIjtLuTro1qa-8XlvUHWAM5Wr8Ol26_Dpds\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T08:18:09.781078+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":585,"images":20,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}